      "versionNonce": 2513496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What a node is",
      "originalText": "What a node is",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 803.52,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197975,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2618225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There is one struct and every parenthesis above is an instance of it. No separate\ntype for an instruction, an expression or a register. That is why a dump reads\nuniformly and why a pass can walk anything without knowing what it is walking.",
      "originalText": "There is one struct and every parenthesis above is an instance of it. No separate\ntype for an instruction, an expression or a register. That is why a dump reads\nuniformly and why a pass can walk anything without knowing what it is walking.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "box026",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 205894,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2722954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "txt027",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "txt027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 164.32,
      "y": 731.25,
      "width": 451.36,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 213813,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2827683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(plus:SI  (reg/v:SI 102 [ <retval> ])  (reg:SI 101))\n ^^^^ ^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n |    |    operand 0                   operand 1\n |    machine mode, 4 bytes of integer\n code, one of 203",
      "originalText": "(plus:SI  (reg/v:SI 102 [ <retval> ])  (reg:SI 101))\n ^^^^ ^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n |    |    operand 0                   operand 1\n |    machine mode, 4 bytes of integer\n code, one of 203",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box026",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 446.4,
      "height": 187.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221732,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2932412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The flags after the slash are printed hints, not\npart of the expression. /v means this register\ncame from a variable you wrote. /i means it is\nthe value being returned. On a MEM the same two\nletters mean different things, which is a good\nreason to look them up rather than guess.\n\nThe square brackets after a register number are\nthe printer telling you which variable it came\nfrom. Delete them and the RTL is unchanged.",
      "originalText": "The flags after the slash are printed hints, not\npart of the expression. /v means this register\ncame from a variable you wrote. /i means it is\nthe value being returned. On a MEM the same two\nletters mean different things, which is a good\nreason to look them up rather than guess.\n\nThe square brackets after a register number are\nthe printer telling you which variable it came\nfrom. Delete them and the RTL is unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 396.8,
      "height": 25.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
